{
  "name": "GitHub -> Portfolio Auto-Update (Notion + X)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "name": "GitHub Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        250,
        400
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "github-portfolio-CHANGE_ME_RANDOM",
        "responseMode": "onReceived",
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Config",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        490,
        400
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "07b1dc62-a2d7-4e19-a2e8-afc46a4c55b2",
              "name": "notionPageId",
              "value": "PASTE_NOTION_PAGE_ID",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Extract Push",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        730,
        400
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const { headers, body } = $('GitHub Webhook').first().json;\nconst isPush = headers['x-github-event'] === 'push';\nconst repo = body.repository || {};\nconst onDefault = body.ref === `refs/heads/${repo.default_branch}`;\nif (!isPush || !onDefault || !body.head_commit) return [];\nreturn [{ json: {\n  repo: repo.full_name,\n  repoUrl: repo.html_url,\n  commitMsg: body.head_commit.message.split('\\n')[0],\n  commitUrl: body.head_commit.url,\n} }];"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Update Notion",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        970,
        400
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "PATCH",
        "url": "=https://api.notion.com/v1/pages/{{ $('Config').first().json.notionPageId }}",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Notion-Version",
              "value": "2022-06-28"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ properties: { 'Last Updated': { date: { start: $now.toISO() } }, 'Latest Commit': { rich_text: [ { text: { content: $json.repo + ': ' + $json.commitMsg, link: { url: $json.commitUrl } } } ] } } }) }}",
        "options": {},
        "authentication": "predefinedCredentialType",
        "nodeCredentialType": "notionApi"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Post to X",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.twitter",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        970,
        580
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "text": "=🚀 Updated {{ $('Extract Push').first().json.repo }} — {{ $('Extract Push').first().json.commitMsg }} {{ $('Extract Push').first().json.repoUrl }}",
        "additionalFields": {}
      },
      "disabled": true
    },
    {
      "name": "Note fb4a",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        200,
        20
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Setup\n1. GitHub repo → Settings → Webhooks → Payload URL:\n   `https://service.example.com/webhook/github-portfolio-CHANGE_ME_RANDOM` (content type JSON, push events).\n   The random path is the shared secret — keep it private.\n2. **Update Notion**: set auth to *Predefined → Notion API* credential; share the page with the integration. Page needs a **Last Updated** (date) and **Latest Commit** (text) property.\n3. **Config**: `notionPageId`.\n4. **Post to X** is disabled — add an X OAuth2 credential and enable it if wanted.\nOnly pushes to the default branch are processed.",
        "width": 960,
        "height": 340,
        "color": 4
      }
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "GitHub Webhook": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Config",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Config": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Extract Push",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Extract Push": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Update Notion",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          },
          {
            "node": "Post to X",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  }
}
